{"id":"439ca13b3038aae3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-hybrid-distribution.md","title":"Hybrid Distributions","display":"df-hybrid-distribution — Hybrid Distributions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-hybrid-distribution","aliases":["28-df-hybrid-distribution","Hybrid Distribution Sequence"],"display":"df-hybrid-distribution — Hybrid Distributions","depends_on":["[[28-df-computational-indistinguishability]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-negl]]"],"source_book_location":"Proof of Theorem 9.11; printed p.182; PDF p.208","source_printed_pages":"182","source_pdf_pages":"208","source_status":"supplementary-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-hybrid-distribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-hybrid-distribution</span><span>Hybrid Distribution Sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hybrid-distribution — Hybrid Distributions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe8c583a58e15f\" href=\"?note=71fe8c583a58e15f\" title=\"28-df-computational-indistinguishability\">28-df-computational-indistinguishability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Proof of Theorem 9.11; printed p.182; PDF p.208"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"182"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"208"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为多项式有界函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{n,i}\">\\(H_{n,i}\\)</span> 为有限字符串分布，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i\\le m(n)\">\\(0\\le i\\le m(n)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le i\\le m(n)\">\\(0\\le i\\le m(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(H_{n,i})\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(n+1)^a}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(H_{n,i})\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(n+1)^a}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 为一比特区分器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>；所有调用的随机性独立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\)</span> 是对全部相邻位置统一控制优势的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i&lt;m(n)\\;\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,H_{n,i})=1]-\\Pr[D(1^n,H_{n,i+1})=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i&lt;m(n)\\;\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,H_{n,i})=1]-\\Pr[D(1^n,H_{n,i+1})=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\Rightarrow (H_{n,0})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\approx_c(H_{n,m(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\Rightarrow (H_{n,0})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\approx_c(H_{n,m(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定输入长度的混合构造见 Theorem 9.11 的证明。三角不等式给出端点优势至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)\\mu(n)\">\\(m(n)\\mu(n)\\)</span>；其截断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\{1,m(n)\\mu(n)\\}\">\\(\\min\\{1,m(n)\\mu(n)\\}\\)</span> 仍可忽略。必须有对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 统一的可忽略界；仅对每个固定位置分别可忽略，不能推出随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 增长的链的端点不可区分。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-computational-indistinguishability","status":"resolved","id":"71fe8c583a58e15f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computational-indistinguishability]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为一比特区分器，$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]；所有调用的随机性独立。$\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)$ 是对全部相邻位置统一控制优势的谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"H_{n,i}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le i\\le m(n)","display":false},{"tex":"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le i\\le m(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(H_{n,i})\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\le c(n+1)^a}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall i<m(n)\\;\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,H_{n,i})=1]-\\Pr[D(1^n,H_{n,i+1})=1]\\right|\\le\\mu(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HybridInd}(H,m)\\Rightarrow (H_{n,0})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\approx_c(H_{n,m(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"m(n)\\mu(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\{1,m(n)\\mu(n)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1708,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"构造与证明工具：[[28-thm-goldreich-levin]]、[[28-thm-prg-from-owf]]、[[28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization]]、[[28-df-hybrid-distribution]]。"}],"outgoing":["71fe8c583a58e15f","b75200f005282ddf","f3171800627deef3"]}